[{"type":"message","user":"U78UYGX8W","text":"\u003c@U78UYGX8W\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1632371914.394500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"dd9a41f8-437f-4f12-a05d-95b773cf5bd1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ですね。仮に直接仮想通貨同士で取引しても、日本で取引したならば「みなし」で円を経由したことになるから利益確定してるので課税対象だっていう論法。","ts":"1632353595.394200","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1632353612.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w07fb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea9e6243-943f-45bc-b33b-d7317f49cd63","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ですね、そこは齟齬ないと思います\nしかし樋口さんなのがなかなか","ts":"1632353479.393200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kWerP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae0ebdee-66be-4fcd-9904-5bf48fd1ac3d","type":"message","user":"UQX22KG9F","text":"\u0026gt; 樋口さんは「課税されるのは法定通貨に換金した場合だけ」と信じて疑わなかった。\n\u0026gt; \n日本円通さなくても追徴課税うけた記事だと思います。","ts":"1632353036.392000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YZm5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff9fa878-1709-40bc-b00c-d7f6c238438f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ですね","ts":"1632351703.390600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=1N1c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a06ead6b-63e9-4998-945c-d2ce65137399","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"その場でビットコイン買ってそれで商品買えば差益は発生しないと考えられるけど、手持ちのビットコインで買ったらそうではないでしょ。","ts":"1632351694.390400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YXQ4f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d720807-bb91-449c-8ec0-e8a61e614746","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"```保有する暗号資産で商品を購入した場合、保有する暗号資産を譲渡したことになりますので、\nこの譲渡に係る所得金額は、その暗号資産の譲渡価額とその暗号資産の譲渡原価等との差額と\nなります。```\nか...","ts":"1632351672.389900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sg1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1989cd97-f9ca-4e3a-ad14-54bdec3b892d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://www.nta.go.jp/publication/pamph/shotoku/kakuteishinkokukankei/kasoutuka/index.htm\u003e\nいや、株とかと同じで、利益発生の時なので、時価計算で物品購入に使っても、それには利益が発生しないから課税にならないかな?","ts":"1632351607.388800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kMo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c018fad7-aa54-44bf-a079-73b5460a1237","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そこらへんどうなってるんでしょうね?\nそっちを別枠にしてるかな....","ts":"1632351490.388000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lAl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99c3933a-651a-4ecb-b183-dcbfbe1d5941","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あ、ビックカメラのビットコインもか","ts":"1632351372.387300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HfLvI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bfe4b708-c550-4ada-b568-fa85cbe99bae","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"モナコイン使えるpc arkとか、税制的には脱税を幇助しちゃいそう。","ts":"1632351312.386900","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1632351321.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W8xC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e2a09c1-45d8-4d38-b07e-0e013ac59f83","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"この理屈で言うと、店頭で仮想通貨使ってモノを買うと、そこで税金発生しうるよな。","ts":"1632351202.385400","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1632351222.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jbwf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a4e682e-9a0c-4193-9f2e-bef08ca57dec","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"株や債券やらでの買い替えとかを考えるとそうなります....よね(やったことないから自信がない)\n基本おなじような扱い","ts":"1632351040.384600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Bj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d70593ec-3108-4479-bc77-7c5a57e23fab","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u0026gt; 保有する仮想通貨を他の仮想通貨を購入する際の決済に使用した場合、その使用時点での他の仮想通貨の時価（購入価額）と保有する仮想通貨の取得価額との差額が、所得金額となります\n日本で取引したならいったん円を経由してるやろ。その時点で利益確定してることになるので課税するよ。って話ね。","ts":"1632350839.383500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xoxo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c085665-b453-4acb-9c05-791e01f5c1cb","type":"message","user":"UQX22KG9F","text":"\u003chttps://toyokeizai.net/articles/-/455654?display=b|https://toyokeizai.net/articles/-/455654?display=b\u003e\n\u0026gt; 保有する暗号資産をほかの暗号資産に乗り換えた場合、保有する暗号資産に生じている含み益が課税対象所得となる\n\u0026gt; \n暗号資産は持ってないから関係無いけど","ts":"1632349641.382100","attachments":[{"fallback":"東洋経済オンライン: 年収300万彼女が追徴課税3000万受けた深刻理由 | 投資","id":1,"title":"年収300万彼女が追徴課税3000万受けた深刻理由 | 投資","title_link":"https://toyokeizai.net/articles/-/455654?display=b","text":"日本居住者のビットコインなど暗号資産投資については、税務申告をめぐる悲劇が存在する。2017年12月の価格急騰局面で、保有する暗号資産を別の暗号資産に等価で乗り換えたあと、その後の暴落に巻き込まれたケース…","image_url":"https://tk.ismcdn.jp/mwimgs/6/2/-/img_62b7762e954fc119390a380b640a5f7d901685.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1632027600,"service_name":"東洋経済オンライン","service_icon":"https://toyokeizai.net/apple-touch-icon.png?20131220","from_url":"https://toyokeizai.net/articles/-/455654?display=b","original_url":"https://toyokeizai.net/articles/-/455654?display=b"}],"edited":{"user":"UQX22KG9F","ts":"1632349689.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ILc9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8ef80ac6-037e-4eab-98a8-5a4b9c084a14","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"一年で額が4/3倍に増えた事例 \u003chttps://dailyhive.com/vancouver/3422-triumph-street-vancouver-assessed-value\u003e Vancouver市内の右端の方らしい","ts":"1632325976.381900","attachments":[{"fallback":"This Vancouver house isn't worth $4 million: owner loses undervaluation appeal | Urbanized","id":1,"title":"This Vancouver house isn't worth $4 million: owner loses undervaluation appeal | Urbanized","title_link":"https://dailyhive.com/vancouver/3422-triumph-street-vancouver-assessed-value","text":"The owner of the single-family house at 3422 Triumph Street in East Vancouver lost his appeal against BC Assessment.","image_url":"https://images.dailyhive.com/20210921164209/3422-Triumph-Street-Vancouver-f-500x258.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"dailyhive.com","service_icon":"https://assets.dailyhive.com/assets/2.3.6/static/icons/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://dailyhive.com/vancouver/3422-triumph-street-vancouver-assessed-value","original_url":"https://dailyhive.com/vancouver/3422-triumph-street-vancouver-assessed-value"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lHu1w"}]}]
